<section class="panel"><h2>Time to the Nearest Minute</h2><p>Source warm-up: hour hand only. Give TOO EARLY, ABOUT RIGHT and TOO LATE estimates; minute hand missing so no fixed reading.</p><h3>Source Lin versus Diego</h3><p><strong>Lin 1:37 PM is correct</strong>, not Diego 1:35 PM. Minute hand at tick 37, two ticks after the 35-minute numeral7.</p><h3>Original four source clock readings: teacher image verification required</h3><table class="source-chart"><thead><tr><th>Clock</th><th>Read actual source image</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A</td><td>________ teacher checks original hour/minute hand</td></tr><tr><td>B</td><td>________ teacher checks original hour/minute hand</td></tr><tr><td>C</td><td>________ teacher checks original hour/minute hand</td></tr><tr><td>D</td><td>________ teacher checks original hour/minute hand</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Original four drawing targets</h3><table class="source-chart"><thead><tr><th>Blank clock</th><th>Target</th><th>Minute tick</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A</td><td>2:36 PM</td><td>36</td></tr><tr><td>B</td><td>3:18 PM</td><td>18</td></tr><tr><td>C</td><td>12:17 PM</td><td>17</td></tr><tr><td>D</td><td>9:02 PM</td><td>2</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Draw short moving hour hands and longer minute hands. Draw a FIFTH self-chosen clock, then TRADE with a partner. Analog hands alone do not reveal AM or PM. Source original artwork and gated publisher Cool-down are not copied.</p></section>